OL,3,GNEWSAYour pictures: Rural autumn scenes
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe cold is starting to bite, autumn
OL,6,Fleaves litter the floor and Halloween
OL,7,Fis upon us.
OL,9,FLast week saw Storm Boelo hit
OL,10,Fnorth-east England and in the time
OL,11,Fsince, there has been sun, showers and
OL,12,Fmore wind.
OL,14,FLuckily the BBC's Weather Watchers have
OL,15,Fbeen on hand to capture some of the
OL,16,Fturbulent weather.
OL,18,FHere are some of our favourite
OL,19,Fpictures.
